In this folder we are providing the optimized structure of ligand 10058-F4 that we subsequently used for docking simulations of 100058-F4 with three states of unbound MAX identified from the 3.5 \micro second WTD-metadynamics simulations.

During the DFT calcultaion aiming for geometry optimization, we have ultilized two levels of theory: B3LYP/6-31G* and M06L/LanL2DZ.
